{"id":"a401bb5f3984f9c5","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-turing-computable-function.md","title":"Turing Computable Partial Functions","display":"df-turing-computable-function — Turing Computable Partial Functions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-turing-computable-function","aliases":["68-df-turing-computable-function"],"display":"df-turing-computable-function — Turing Computable Partial Functions","depends_on":["[[68-df-turing-machine-computation]]"],"source_location":"Local reconstruction of missing interfaces from the supplied 68 archive; original external text unavailable","verification_status":"local-formalization-reviewed","source_proof_status":"not-proof-assistant-checked","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-turing-computable-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-turing-computable-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-computable-function — Turing Computable Partial Functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3c982f03a066db1\" href=\"?note=d3c982f03a066db1\" title=\"68-df-turing-machine-computation\">68-df-turing-machine-computation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local reconstruction of missing interfaces from the supplied 68 archive; original external text unavailable"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathcal F_k\">\\(f\\in\\mathcal F_k\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr M_{68}^{\\mathrm{num}}\">\\(\\mathscr M_{68}^{\\mathrm{num}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^{\\mathrm{TM}}_{M,k}\">\\(F^{\\mathrm{TM}}_{M,k}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_k\">\\(\\mathcal F_k\\)</span> 及其固定输入/输出规则见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3c982f03a066db1\" href=\"?note=d3c982f03a066db1\" title=\"68-df-turing-machine-computation\">68-df-turing-machine-computation</a> 及其上游。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{68}(k,f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_{68}(k,f)\\)</span> 为带元数的可计算性谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}^{(k)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}^{(k)}\\)</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}\\)</span> 保留原目录的全元数接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{68}(k,f)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;f\\in\\mathcal F_k\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathscr M_{68}^{\\mathrm{num}}\\;(f=F^{\\mathrm{TM}}_{M,k}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Comp}_{68}(k,f)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;f\\in\\mathcal F_k\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathscr M_{68}^{\\mathrm{num}}\\;(f=F^{\\mathrm{TM}}_{M,k}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}^{(k)}:=\\{f\\in\\mathcal F_k:\\mathrm{Comp}_{68}(k,f)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Computable}:=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Computable}^{(k)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Computable}^{(k)}:=\\{f\\in\\mathcal F_k:\\mathrm{Comp}_{68}(k,f)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Computable}:=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Computable}^{(k)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原文件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{88}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_{88}\\)</span> 只有外部名称，没有可用定义；现由本书实际定义的运行图替换。函数类允许偏函数，包括处处无定义函数和零元偏函数。图相等同时约束定义域及输出值，不能仅要求在有定义输入上返回正确值而放任其余输入产生额外结果。这里没有用“偏递归”反过来定义“图灵可计算”，因此模型等价定理不是循环同义反复。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-turing-machine-computation","status":"resolved","id":"d3c982f03a066db1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-machine-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-machine-computation","status":"resolved","id":"d3c982f03a066db1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathcal F_k$。$\\mathscr M_{68}^{\\mathrm{num}}$、$F^{\\mathrm{TM}}_{M,k}$、$\\mathcal F_k$ 及其固定输入/输出规则见 [[68-df-turing-machine-computation]] 及其上游。$\\mathrm{Comp}_{68}(k,f)$ 为带元数的可计算性谓词；$\\mathrm{Computable}^{(k)}$ 为第 $k$ 元类，$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 保留原目录的全元数接口。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathcal F_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr M_{68}^{\\mathrm{num}}","display":false},{"tex":"F^{\\mathrm{TM}}_{M,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_{68}(k,f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computable}^{(k)}","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_{68}(k,f)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;f\\in\\mathcal F_k\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathscr M_{68}^{\\mathrm{num}}\\;(f=F^{\\mathrm{TM}}_{M,k}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computable}^{(k)}:=\\{f\\in\\mathcal F_k:\\mathrm{Comp}_{68}(k,f)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Computable}:=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Computable}^{(k)}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_{88}","display":false}],"bytes":1797,"backlinks":[{"id":"f25b8a41e54b05e7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 是 [[68-df-turing-computable-function]] 的本地图灵机偏函数类，$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 是 [[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]] 的闭包定义函数类。两类使用的机器、运行和输入输出规则均为第 68 本的本地定义；本条直接采用 [[68-thm-turing-recursive-equivalence]]。"},{"id":"fd495d9c69fc281b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 是 [[68-df-turing-computable-function]] 的本地图灵机偏函数类，$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 见 [[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]]。图灵机的机器集合、输入编码、配置演化和输出规则全部取 [[68-df-turing-machine-computation]] 的固定定义。基本机器与偏递归函数类的对应见 [[68-thm-basic-machine-characterization]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-computable-function]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-computable-function]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"图灵机、运行和可计算函数的定义已经存在于本次附件中，分别见 [[68-df-turing-machine]]、[[68-df-turing-machine-computation]]、[[68-df-turing-computable-function]]。本轮逐一解析原包文件目标与历史别名，未发现显式悬空文件链接，不将原包关于先前缺失第 88 本正文的历史说明误当作当前数学前提。原包此前已将旧 Church–Turing 条目中的过时外部证明要求改为 [[68-thm-turing-recursive-equivalence]] 的本地依赖；保留的等式入口为 [[68-cor-turing-recursive-class-equality]]。"}],"outgoing":["d3c982f03a066db1"]}